# Documentation for this repo

When an agreed Kitchen Skills or GameBus-integration change is implemented, update the canonical docs in the **same change**. Do not leave stale “reopen iframe” or “students hydrate only from `kitchenGroupInput`” statements.

- Index: [`docs/README.md`](docs/README.md) (Diátaxis: Tutorials / How-to / Reference / Explanation).
- Official GameBus pages: [`docs/contracts/GAMEBUS.md`](docs/contracts/GAMEBUS.md) — link them; do not paste those docs here.
- Kitchen Skills product: [`docs/product/kitchen-skills-challenge/`](docs/product/kitchen-skills-challenge/).
- Status: [`docs/current-state/IMPLEMENTATION_STATUS.md`](docs/current-state/IMPLEMENTATION_STATUS.md).
- Do not rewrite [`docs/archive/`](docs/archive/) to match current behaviour.
